        "title": "Capacity may be overstated during rollout",
        "detail": "Unreserved Pod requests and a firing KubeCPUOvercommit alert mean free capacity is uncertain; with maxUnavailable: 0 / maxSurge: 1 the old Pod plus surge Pod must both fit.",
